xdiff from Git 2.56.0 (the bpr_xdiff shared library)

BetterPullReview uses the xdiff library from Git 2.56.0 to match the lines of
the two sides of a diff. xdiff is distributed with BetterPullReview as its own
shared library, separate from every BetterPullReview executable, which link to
it dynamically and contain no copy of it:

  macOS    BetterPullReview.app/Contents/Frameworks/libbpr_xdiff.dylib
  Windows  bpr_xdiff.dll, beside better_pull_review.exe
  Linux    lib/betterpullreview/libbpr_xdiff.so, beside the application

